/* DATA DESCRIPTION:
Citation:	Miller, Heinrich; Jokat, Wilfried; Steinhage, Daniel; Helm, Veit (2025): ANT 2004/05: AWI airborne Radio-Echo Sounding Data over western DML, south of Heimefrontfjella and over the upstream region of Slessor Ice Stream, East Antarctica (EPICA and VISA projects) [dataset]. PANGAEA, https://doi.org/10.1594/PANGAEA.983337
Abstract:	This dataset contains airborne radar data acquired using the AWI EMR system during the Antarctic season of 2004/05. The profiles extend across the western Dronning Maud Land south of Heimefrontfjella and over the upstream region of Slessor Ice Stream. The data are available as netCDF files (including waveforms and metadata), KML files of the profile line locations, and quicklook images of the radargrams.
Keyword(s):	Antarctic Ice Sheet; AWI EMR; Dronning Maud Land; Polar 2; radio-echo sounding; Slessor Ice Stream
Related to:	Eisen, Olaf; Steinhage, Daniel; Franke, Steven; Helm, Veit; Binder, Tobias; Drews, Reinhard; Eagles, Graeme; Humbert, Angelika; Jansen, Daniela; Jokat, Wilfried; Lambrecht, Astrid; Mieth, Matthias; Riedel, Sven; Miller, Heinrich (2024): Collection of datasets from AWI's radio-echo sounding systems on ice sheets and glaciers [dataset bibliography]. PANGAEA, https://doi.org/10.1594/PANGAEA.972094
